=4 Walkthrough
* You will have to zone after completing the previous quest.
* Talk to {n:Kororo} in the {p:Manustery} at (H-9) in {z:Windurst Woods}.
* Talk to the Cardian that {n:Kororo} mentions.
** Choose any of the greetings, it doesn't matter what choice you make.
* Leave {z:Windurst Woods}, then return after one earth minute and talk to {n:Kororo} again.
* The Cardian you are looking for is the {n:Five of Spades}. He is at the outpost in {z:Buburimu Peninsula}.
* Go to {z:Buburimu Peninsula} and speak to {n:Five of Spades}.
* Return to {n:Kororo} to receive your reward.

